// The Fremennik Trials. %viking carries only not-started / started / complete - the six trials are
// done in any order and each is a bit in %viking_bits, so there is no linear ordering to put here.
// The value 10 is left as this file already had it rather than renumbered, so nothing that already
// compares against it moves. See quests/quest_viking/configs/quest_viking.constant.
^viking_complete = 10
^mm_complete = 20
^recruitmentdrive_complete = 2
^roving_elves_complete = 10
// Mourning's End Part I. Built and finishable: quest_mourning.rs2:153 reaches this value, awards
// 25,000 Ranged XP and the excavation key, and calls ~send_quest_complete.
// (This comment used to say only the first half was built and that nothing reached the value. That
// was true when it was written and is not true now - it was left in place long enough to mislead
// an audit of this quest, so it is corrected rather than deleted.)
// See quests/quest_mourning/configs/quest_mourning.constant.
^mourning_complete = 20
^deserttreasure_complete = 15
